+                  // (the frame's, where it drew nothing: ease holds the depth's SRV index and the view's depth at the
+                  // buffer's 0 and 1), and the share of the frame it covers (rgb the mean, alpha the share that had any), 2: ease
+                  // the room's mean toward the last level's
