From: PlatinumMimic <julianharmon100@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:17:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 24/47] Ray tracing: characters gain none of the bounce above
 the room's average (XBE_RT_GI_CHAR_BOOST 0)

The game lights Hector and the enemies with lights of their own; added to theirs, what the rays found above the
room's average stood them out 30-60% brighter than the floor beside them. They still give up their share of the
game's light where they get less (XBE_RT_GI_CHAR_FILL).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P39J2YaGgWez1ZqKbAmtKk
