rt_lights.hlsli holds the lights' sampling (PickLight, LightAt) for rt_gi and rt_ao.
The bounce rays take the lights' light where they meet a surface, in its colour
(XBE_RT_GI_BOUNCE2, 1; XBE_RT_GI_BOUNCE2_TRIES, 2). Ambient occlusion picks a
light for each pixel and traces characters toward it, darkening by its share of
the pixel's light (XBE_RT_SHADOWS_LAMPS, 0.7).

